{"2659600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ammossum", "steam_appid": 2659600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/9e3b6493f665323e2835195800eb27cc.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b41686238afbcd93997c2418470c766b.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b41686238afbcd93997c2418470c766b.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b41686238afbcd93997c2418470c766b.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart, and your family has been taken from you. The infected swarm the railroads, the plague spreads, and the only way forward is through fire and chaos. Keep the train moving, search for answers, and face the truth waiting at the end of the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/18d1115db641e2a03f3d7464f25f9505.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/51f38624c12ea6cacef8965e98268592.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/51f38624c12ea6cacef8965e98268592.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/51f38624c12ea6cacef8965e98268592.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for ordinary guns when you can craft pure chaos? Combine and evolve your projectiles—nest them within each other, fuse them into devastating combos, and fill the battlefield with nonstop explosions. The possibilities are endless, and so is the firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/82f31abce1e0006e06dbbb667d5458ce.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b6fac6a74cb29d7a842e70b240999dda.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b6fac6a74cb29d7a842e70b240999dda.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b6fac6a74cb29d7a842e70b240999dda.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your train isn’t just a ride—it’s part of your build. Each railcar adds unique bonuses, from economy to battlefield control. Pick the right upgrades, mix the synergies, and fine-tune your setup to turn every fight in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/0a536bb7e2e38fac344c641bee8a6efb.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/6758789b73e6b53ff080a764599d41bb.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/6758789b73e6b53ff080a764599d41bb.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/6758789b73e6b53ff080a764599d41bb.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings discoveries. Unlock weapons, find hidden mechanics, and expand your arsenal with each attempt. The more you play, the stronger—and wilder—your options become. Experiment, and push your limits with each new attempt—because no two runs are the same! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/9e3b6493f665323e2835195800eb27cc.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b41686238afbcd93997c2418470c766b.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b41686238afbcd93997c2418470c766b.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b41686238afbcd93997c2418470c766b.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart, and your family has been taken from you. The infected swarm the railroads, the plague spreads, and the only way forward is through fire and chaos. Keep the train moving, search for answers, and face the truth waiting at the end of the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/18d1115db641e2a03f3d7464f25f9505.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/51f38624c12ea6cacef8965e98268592.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/51f38624c12ea6cacef8965e98268592.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/51f38624c12ea6cacef8965e98268592.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for ordinary guns when you can craft pure chaos? Combine and evolve your projectiles—nest them within each other, fuse them into devastating combos, and fill the battlefield with nonstop explosions. The possibilities are endless, and so is the firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/82f31abce1e0006e06dbbb667d5458ce.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b6fac6a74cb29d7a842e70b240999dda.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b6fac6a74cb29d7a842e70b240999dda.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/b6fac6a74cb29d7a842e70b240999dda.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your train isn’t just a ride—it’s part of your build. Each railcar adds unique bonuses, from economy to battlefield control. Pick the right upgrades, mix the synergies, and fine-tune your setup to turn every fight in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/0a536bb7e2e38fac344c641bee8a6efb.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/6758789b73e6b53ff080a764599d41bb.poster.avif?t=1788127821\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/6758789b73e6b53ff080a764599d41bb.webm?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/extras/6758789b73e6b53ff080a764599d41bb.mp4?t=1788127821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings discoveries. Unlock weapons, find hidden mechanics, and expand your arsenal with each attempt. The more you play, the stronger—and wilder—your options become. Experiment, and push your limits with each new attempt—because no two runs are the same! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build an endlessly upgradable weapon! Evolve projectiles into unstoppable firepower in this action roguelike. Fight through hordes of infected beasts, hunt down the source of the plague, and feel the thrill of bloody shootouts filled with bullets, explosions, and acid. Can you survive the madness?", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, Japanese, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/e28a8ff532169de8bb910557c60f8307fe3f9fed/header.jpg?t=1788127821", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/f31469325c3f66d4523c412670cce8d0bc23fe69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788127821", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659600/f31469325c3f66d4523c412670cce8d0bc23fe69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788127821", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 640 / Radeon HD 7750 / Intel UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600k / AMD FX-9590<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 / Radeon R9 390X / Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong